{
  "description": "通过任务开始时冻结的 GPT OAuth 或已显式启用的 OpenAI Images API 连接生成图片。target 只绑定获授权文档，不代表应用；省略返回工作空间候选。用户明确生成并插入或替换时，传 application:{mode:insert|replace,target:已观察句柄}，软件冻结目标，生成后一次正式应用并返回独立 generation/application/save 结果；人工同目标变更或停止不覆盖，图片保留，无需再生成。候选可用 project.apply from 或 media.apply，也可将 htmlSource 用作局部 HTML 图片/CSS URL。当前请求 PNG、auto/low/medium/high 画质。",
  "inputSchema": {
    "$defs": {
      "__schema0": {
        "minLength": 1,
        "type": "string"
      }
    },
    "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
    "additionalProperties": false,
    "properties": {
      "application": {
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "mode": {
            "enum": [
              "insert",
              "replace"
            ],
            "type": "string"
          },
          "target": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/__schema0"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "mode",
          "target"
        ],
        "type": "object"
      },
      "output": {
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "background": {
            "enum": [
              "auto",
              "opaque",
              "transparent"
            ],
            "type": "string"
          },
          "format": {
            "const": "png",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "quality": {
            "enum": [
              "auto",
              "low",
              "medium",
              "high"
            ],
            "type": "string"
          },
          "size": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "const": "auto",
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "pattern": "^\\d{2,5}x\\d{2,5}$",
                "type": "string"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "type": "object"
      },
      "prompt": {
        "minLength": 1,
        "type": "string"
      },
      "target": {
        "$ref": "#/$defs/__schema0"
      }
    },
    "required": [
      "prompt"
    ],
    "type": "object"
  },
  "invocation": "静态目录只说明已登记接口；当前运行是否可调用、文档范围、写权限、短句柄和服务配置，以宿主本轮发现与实际回执为准。",
  "manual": {
    "group": "edit",
    "label": "image.generate",
    "targetKinds": [
      "document",
      "course-surface",
      "course-instance"
    ]
  },
  "name": "image.generate",
  "version": 1
}
